{"unit_id":"Ultroncn__dsh-liquid-glass#card-zh","repo":"Ultroncn/dsh-liquid-glass","commit":"09455971a84f120063f0b4c7c7cf530dd5398161","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-liquid-glass 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的外观插件，在设置通用页提供液态玻璃开关、透明度滑块和自定义壁纸控件。它通过主题 token 覆盖让页面及多类界面表面呈现半透明效果，并支持亮暗配色；用户可上传图片或填写图片 URL，预览、保存或移除背景。透明度和壁纸保存在当前浏览器，适合希望个性化 DSH 界面并让背景透出的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:184-216","lib/client.js:629-679"]}
{"unit_id":"Ultroncn__dsh-liquid-glass#card-en","repo":"Ultroncn/dsh-liquid-glass","commit":"09455971a84f120063f0b4c7c7cf530dd5398161","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-liquid-glass adds a glass toggle, opacity slider, and custom wallpaper controls to DSH Web settings. Theme token overrides make interface surfaces translucent in light and dark schemes. Users can upload or link a background, preview it, and change it. Preferences stay in the browser.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:184-216","lib/client.js:629-679"]}
