{"unit_id":"Ultroncn__dsh-liquid-glass#caveat-local-preferences","repo":"Ultroncn/dsh-liquid-glass","commit":"09455971a84f120063f0b4c7c7cf530dd5398161","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-liquid-glass 使用前须知：玻璃开关、透明度和壁纸都保存在当前浏览器的 localStorage；浏览器存储不可用或空间不足时，读写会被忽略。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:36-58"]}
